====================================================================================================
  F_C = 0.999990774257777   F_C^2 = 0.999981548600668   F_K = 0.999981548600668   |F_K - F_C^2| = 0.0
  F_avg = 0.999987699067112   (2 F_C^2 + 1)/3 = 0.999987699067112
  1 - F_K = 1.84513993321e-5 against 2(1 - F_C) = 1.84514844464e-5  (ratio 0.9999953871, -> 1 as eps -> 0)
  1 - F_avg = 1.23009328881e-5 against (4/3)(1 - F_C) = 1.23009896309e-5
  LYC's printed F = ||U V^dag||_2 for unitaries = 1.0  (identically 1)
  BHC's printed 1 - ||V^dag U||_2               = 7.779e-62  (identically 0)
  order n  <=>  residual O(eps^{n+1})  <=>  distance slope n+1  <=>  infidelity slope 2(n+1)

