  general target axis: ||U_T^(phi_0) - Z(phi_0) U_T^(0) Z(phi_0)^dag|| = 1.748e-61 at phi_0 = 0.7 (ADD the offset to every phase, zeroth pulse included)
  W1 = R(pi,phi)R(2 pi,3 phi)R(pi,phi) at zero error: ||W1 - I|| = 3.649e-61, ||W1 + I|| = 2.0 -- it is +I, NOT -I as the brief's check claims
